WEBVTT

00:13:29.685 --> 00:13:35.135
So I think that kind of
self-diagnostic exercise is helpful.

00:13:35.159 --> 00:13:37.005
CA: OK, so, you became a writer.

00:13:37.029 --> 00:13:41.785
And you felt some relief and some,
"I have come home" sense to the decision.

00:13:41.809 --> 00:13:46.652
SC: More than some. More like every day,
overflowing sense of it.

00:13:46.676 --> 00:13:51.228
CA: But that was still six or seven years
before "Quiet" was published.

00:13:51.252 --> 00:13:53.536
SC: Oh, yeah.
CA: So seven years is a long time.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:55.755
How many doubts were there
during that period?

00:13:55.779 --> 00:13:57.754
SC: None, because, as I say --

00:13:57.778 --> 00:13:58.935
CA: Wow, none?

00:13:58.959 --> 00:14:04.752
SC:... my mindset was that my goal was
to publish something by the time I was 75.